TUI + minimal-web + mirror crates) satisfies the UX requirements
catalogued in MS043 R10087-R10298.

Install path: /usr/bin/selfdef-ux-harness
Systemd timer: /etc/systemd/system/selfdef-ux-harness.timer (post-commit hook)

Doctrine preserved verbatim (MS045 derivation):
  L1 = schema/lint (no virtualization)
  L2 = CLI startup latency p95 < 50ms (MS043 R10137)
  L3 = TUI keyboard replayer via PTY (MS043 R10150-R10155)
  L4 = web contrast checker WCAG 2.1 AA 4.5:1 (MS043 R10175)
  L5 = web keyboard replayer via Playwright (MS043 R10263-R10266)

Standing rule: "the AI does NOT decide when it's complete"
This harness reports per-check pass/fail; operator decides commit-gate.
"""

